T:Singin' in the Rain
C:Nacio Herb Brown, 1929
O:Singin' in the Rain (1952), Gene Kelly
N:Lyrics by Arthur Freed. Melody from the vibraphone line of a sequenced
N:MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com track 16325), one full chorus. The
N:arrangement swings the rhythm with sixteenth-note anticipations; those
N:are straightened to eighths here, so the written rhythm is simpler than
N:the film's. Chords simplified from its bass.
N:Single source, not cross-checked.
